seekwright check
================
config      check_transitional.toml  (present)
default     exa:free
permitted   (unset: every enabled provider)
providers
  enabled   exa:free
  effective exa:free
  built     exa:free
  untested  exa:free is untested on this port: no live verification against the real endpoint has happened in the OCaml build, and a reachability probe is not one
  exa:free  no connectivity probe  unbilled
  probes    no connectivity probe on this port for: exa:free -- built here, and their readiness is the MCP handshake at warmup
fetch
  enabled   40000 chars max, 3 redirects, private addresses allowed (the local reader is built with the private-web grant)
  primary   jina keyless
  extractor stdlib
  fallback  jina
  jina      keyless
  cache     check_cache (256 MiB cap, ttl 300s)  0 entries, 0 B
agent
  disabled in config
